DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260628T170000
UID:260603c8toZq6U30ykkbKNMXLUIQ
DESCRIPTION:ISCI is excited to host a Civics Literacy Lab presented by MAD
 Voters. This interactive workshop will provide important\, nonpartisan inf
 ormation about the civic process so attendees can better advocate for them
 selves and their communities.\n\nParticipants will learn about voter eligi
 bility\, registration\, and ID laws\; 2026 election information\; the role
 s of elected officials\; the legislative process\; and ways to take action
  in your community.\n\nPlease arrive by 2:45pm so the training can begin p
 romptly at 3:00pm.
LOCATION:Monroe County Library - Ellettsville Branch
